        "renderShape": {
          "kind": "markdown"
        },
        "markdown": "# Tyler Bowyer\n\nArizona political organizer and conservative activist. Bowyer joined Turning Point USA in 2015, later became its chief operating officer, and shifted his full-time focus to Turning Point Action in 2022 as that organization’s COO.\n\nBowyer was also one of Arizona’s 2020 alternate Republican electors. This graph records the related state prosecution with its current procedural posture and without implying guilt. Claims made in **Bride of Charlie** remain attributed to those episodes rather than treated as independent verification.",
        "view": {
          "intent": "graph",
          "payload": "graph.web.detail"
        },
        "label": "Tyler Bowyer Profile"
      }
